ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nAunt Wang and Uncle Li are both old residents of the community, Aunt Wang lives under Uncle Li's apartment. Recently, Uncle Li's son and daughter-in-law come home, they often party until midnight. One afternoon, Aunt Wang sits on a bench in the park, watching the children play. Xiao Ming is Uncle Li's grandson, he plays in the park. Aunt Wang looks at Xiao Ming, then looks at Uncle Li who is maintaining the lawn in the distance. Aunt Wang takes out a note, and carefully hands it to Xiao Ming, then gently pats Xiao Ming's head. After Xiao Ming gets the note, he first looks at Aunt Wang's expression, then runs to find his grandfather, Uncle Li.\n\n[Question]\nHow do you think Uncle Li feels after seeing the note?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Uncle Li is a bit angry, he does not like others to pass messages through children.\nB. Uncle Li feels relieved, he understands this may be Aunt Wang caring about his living conditions.\nC. Uncle Li feels a bit guilty, because he does not consider that it affects Aunt Wang's rest.\nD. Uncle Li is very happy, because he thinks Aunt Wang is very friendly to him.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004609399491129482,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b10c2ddb05a7fe2f7db","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452240271,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:57:20","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"368e744a90474fbea9ca852d0c1fa7ec"}